<headroom-library version="1" id="hg-breakdown-chug" category="High Gain" order="170" instrument="guitar" style="Metalcore">
  <description>2000s metalcore rhythm: a hard gate and a drive-at-zero overdrive into a 120-watt lead channel with punchy mids, into a V30 4x12. Less gain than you would think and more mids, so drop-C chugs hit like a kick drum and the breakdown stops are dead silent.</description>
  <tags><tag>High Gain</tag><tag>Metalcore</tag><tag>Rhythm</tag><tag>Breakdown</tag><tag>Boosted</tag><tag>Gate</tag><tag>Drop Tuning</tag></tags>
